<Base title="About La Terra Café" description="Story behind La Terra Café." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/portfolio-sites/' }, { label: 'La Terra Café', href: '/portfolio-sites/demos/restaurant/' }, { label: 'About' }]}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">From Salerno to the Northern Quarter</h1>
    <p>Owner-chef Giulia Rizzo trained in Salerno before settling in Manchester. La Terra Café celebrates produce from small Italian growers alongside British suppliers, with menus shifting weekly.</p>
    <p>Our coffee programme features seasonal beans from UK roasters. Sustainability matters, so we compost, source green energy, and pay the Living Wage.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
